---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About VisaPath.pk"
  description="VisaPath.pk provides free visa calculators and travel guides for Pakistani passport holders."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose">
    <h1>About VisaPath.pk</h1>
    <p>
      VisaPath.pk is a free resource built for Pakistani travelers. We make visa calculators, document checklists, and country-specific travel guides to help you plan international trips with confidence.
    </p>
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      Navigating visa rules can be confusing. Processing times vary, fees change, and requirements differ between embassies. We built this site to put accurate, up-to-date information in one place — translated for Pakistani travelers.
    </p>
    <h2>What We Offer</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Interactive visa calculators (Schengen days, visa fees, processing times)</li>
      <li>Country-by-country visa guides for popular destinations</li>
      <li>Document checklists tailored by visa type</li>
      <li>Travel insurance and currency tools</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>
      VisaPath.pk is operated by travel professionals with over two decades of experience in international travel, visa consulting, and consumer travel services. We are based in Pakistan and serve the global Pakistani diaspora.
    </p>
    <p>
      For questions or feedback, visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
